@* A few steps in order (ADR 0125): each its number in a violet glass circle, centred beside its title and words as one
   quiet sentence however many lines they run to (Louis: "not centered"). The layout is Bootstrap's (ADR 0085). A site
   gives them as records. *@
<ol class="steps list-unstyled d-grid gap-3 m-0 p-0">
    @for (var index = 0; index < Items.Count; index++)
    {
        var step = Items[index];
        <li class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
            <span class="step-number flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">@(index + 1)</span>
            <span class="step-words"><span class="step-title">@step.Title</span> @Markdown.Inline(step.Text)</span>
        </li>
    }
</ol>
